msgstr ""

#: ../../../projects_using_gazebo.md:14
msgid ""
"**Aerostack2**: An open-source autonomous multi-aerial-robots systems "
"framework. [{octicon}`globe` link](https://github.com/aerostack2/aerostack2)"
msgstr ""

