#: ../../../projects_using_gazebo.md:15
msgid ""
"**ArduPilot**: ArduPilot is an autopilot built on ChibiOS RTOS that supports "
"many vehicle types. [{octicon}`globe` link](https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/"
"sitl-with-gazebo.html)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projects_using_gazebo.md:16
msgid ""
"**CogniPilot**: CogniPilot is an autopilot built on Zephyr RTOS that "
"supports many vehicle types. [{octicon}`globe` link](https://cognipilot.org) "
"| <https://github.com/CogniPilot/synapse_gz>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projects_using_gazebo.md:18
msgid ""
"**gz_ros2_control**: ROS 2 package for integrating `ros2_control` and "
"Gazebo. [{octicon}`globe` link](https://control.ros.org/jazzy/doc/"
"gz_ros2_control/doc/index.html) | <https://github.com/ros-controls/"
"gz_ros2_control>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projects_using_gazebo.md:21
msgid ""
"**gz-sim-yarp-plugins**: Integration of Gazebo with YARP devices, used for "
"simulation of iCub and ergoCub humanoid robots. [{octicon}`globe` link]"
"(https://github.com/robotology/gz-sim-yarp-plugins)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projects_using_gazebo.md:22
msgid ""
"**heightmap_spawner**: A ROS 2 package that converts occupancy grids from "
"nav2_map_server into 3D heightmap models for use in Gazebo simulations. "
"[{octicon}`globe` link](https://github.com/damanikjosh/heightmap_spawner)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projects_using_gazebo.md:23
msgid ""
"**MBARI Buoy Sim**: Wave simulation for energy buoy control. [{octicon}"
"`globe` link](https://github.com/osrf/buoy_sim)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projects_using_gazebo.md:24
msgid ""
"**MBARI LRAUV**: Underwater simulation for glider science missions. "
"[{octicon}`globe` link](https://github.com/osrf/lrauv)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projects_using_gazebo.md:25
msgid ""
"**MBZIRC**: Maritime competition for surface and aerial vehicles with "
"manipulation. [{octicon}`globe` link](https://github.com/osrf/mbzirc)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projects_using_gazebo.md:26
msgid ""
"**Nav2**: ROS 2 Navigation framework and system. [{octicon}`globe` link]"
"(https://nav2.org/) | <https://github.com/ros-navigation/navigation2>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projects_using_gazebo.md:29
msgid ""
"**Open-RMF**: Warehouse robot fleet sharing and interoperability between "
"multiple fleets of robots and physical infrastructure. [{octicon}`globe` "
"link](https://www.open-rmf.org/)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projects_using_gazebo.md:30
msgid ""
"**PhantomX Pincher Robot Arm**: Manipulation packages in ROS 2, MoveIt 2, "
"and new Gazebo for a class at the University of Luxembourg. [{octicon}"
"`globe` link](https://github.com/snt-spacer/phantomx_pincher/tree/ros2)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projects_using_gazebo.md:31
msgid ""
"**PX4**: PX4 is an autopilot built on Nuttx RTOS that supports many vehicle "
"types. [{octicon}`globe` link](https://docs.px4.io/v1.15/en/sim_gazebo_gz/)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projects_using_gazebo.md:32
msgid ""
"**Space ROS**: An open-source space robotics framework for developing flight-"
"quality robotic and autonomous space systems. [{octicon}`globe` link]"
"(https://space.ros.org/)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projects_using_gazebo.md:33
msgid ""
"**SubT**: DARPA Subterranean Challenge. [{octicon}`globe` link](https://"
"github.com/osrf/subt)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projects_using_gazebo.md:34
msgid ""
"**Turtlebot 4**: Low-cost educational robot. [{octicon}`globe` link](https://"
"clearpathrobotics.com/turtlebot-4)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projects_using_gazebo.md:35
msgid ""
"**VRX**: Virtual RobotX, maritime surface vehicle competition. [{octicon}"
"`globe` link](https://github.com/osrf/vrx)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projects_using_gazebo.md:36
msgid ""
"**gazebo_terrain_generator**: A super easy-to-use tool for generate 3D "
"Gazebo terrain using real-world elevation and satellite data. [{octicon}"
"`globe` link](https://github.com/saiaravind19/gazebo_terrain_generator)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projects_using_gazebo.md:38
msgid "Gazebo Plugins"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projects_using_gazebo.md:40
msgid ""
"**gz_sim_spray_painting_plugin**: A Gazebo plugin that simulates spray "
"painting through ray-casting and particle emitter visual effects. This "
"plugin will help you visualize your paint coverage for your autonomous spray "
"painting applications. [{octicon}`globe` link](https://github.com/topguns837/"
"gz_sim_spray_painting_plugin)"
msgstr ""
